## Interface: 120107, 120105, 50504, 40402, 30405, 20506, 16001, 11509
## Title: Chatty Little NPC - Tools
## Notes: Portrait camera, book & letter model, logs and model inspection windows. Loaded by Chatty Little NPC when one of them is opened.
## Author: Tuubby
## Version: 3.8.0
## Dependencies: ChattyLittleNpc
## LoadOnDemand: 1
## Group: ChattyLittleNpc

# Chatty Little NPC loads this module with C_AddOns.LoadAddOn() the first time
# one of these windows is opened (src/Tools.lua). The settings they change are
# saved in the main addon's profile, so playback never needs this module.
# Keep ## Interface and ## Version in step with the main .toc.

# Logs window (the log buffer itself stays in the main addon: LogsBuffer.lua)
LogsView.lua
LogsWindow.lua

# Model inspection: /clndebug, /clnmodel
DebugWindow.lua

# Labels NPC models whose race is unknown (data saved by ChattyLittleNpc_Collector)
RaceModelManager.lua

# Display settings windows
Db/ItemPropCandidates.lua
ItemPropPicker.lua
PortraitTuner.lua
